          "fact": "F24",
          "source": "thm-chain-sum-product-and-composition-rules-for-banach-derivatives",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "**Chain rule.** If $f : U \\to Y$ is Fréchet differentiable at $x$, if $W_0 \\subseteq Y$ is an open set with $f[U] \\subseteq W_0$, and if $g : W_0 \\to Z$ is Fréchet differentiable at $f(x)$, then $g \\circ f$ is Fréchet differentiable at $x$ and $$D(g \\circ f)(x) = Dg\\bigl(f(x)\\bigr)\\,Df(x).$$",
          "uses": [
            "1.1",
            "2.1",
            "2.2"
          ]
        }
      ],
